{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026382XKd0XSx1795365816.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔有唐狗懷疑被虐待致死，警方拘捕一人。</p><p></p><p>案件交由大埔警區刑事調查隊調查。</p><p></p><p>警方是在中午12時半接獲一名女子報案，發現她飼養的唐狗，被吊在衛奕信徑第8段其所住石屋外的樹上，沒有生命跡象。</p><p></p><p>而報案人的弟弟及幾位朋友，在案發位置附近，報案人相信是他們所為，警方調查後拘捕她弟弟，暫時列作殘酷對待動物。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T17:44:13.669848+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T15:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:10.448330+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T17:37:35.837773+00:00","content_hash":"f183a037d68a164469aca16cca111e75254a9d20fdd8df88fae21677c4bc5fe1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T17:44:13.669848+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}